      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Cada noche, después de comer, los Lobos se sentaban a mirar el cielo.",
          "en": "Every evening, after dinner, the Wolves sat looking up at the sky."
        },
        {
          "es": "'¿Qué miran?', preguntaba Coyote. Pero no le decían.",
          "en": "'What are you looking at?' Coyote asked. But they would not tell him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Preguntó una y otra vez. Por fin le dijeron: 'Allá arriba hay dos animales.'",
          "en": "He asked again and again. At last, they told him: 'There are two animals up there.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "'Pero no podemos llegar', dijeron los Lobos. 'Están demasiado alto.'",
          "en": "'But we cannot get to them,' said the Wolves. 'They are much too high.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "'Eso es fácil', dijo Coyote. 'Yo los llevo.'",
          "en": "'That is easy,' said Coyote. 'I will take you there.'"
        }
      ],
