    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "fondo": "noche",
      "camara": {
        "de": 0,
        "a": 0,
        "zoom": [
          1,
          1.05
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Coyote los miró, y le gustó lo que vio. 'Qué lindo cuadro', pensó.",
          "en": "Coyote looked at them, and he liked what he saw. 'That makes a fine picture,' he thought."
        },
        {
          "es": "'Los voy a dejar así, para que todos los vean para siempre.'",
          "en": "'I will leave them just like that, so everyone can see them for all time.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "Así que Coyote bajó, sacando las flechas detrás de él, una por una.",
